\PYG{l+s+sd}{==== Action Guidelines ====}
\PYG{l+s+sd}{You have TWO actions available:}

\PYG{l+s+sd}{1. **execute** \PYGZhy{} Run shell commands and observe results}
\PYG{l+s+sd}{   \PYGZhy{} Use this to install packages, configure services, verify status, etc.}
\PYG{l+s+sd}{   \PYGZhy{} Example: \PYGZdq{}apt update \PYGZam{}\PYGZam{} apt install \PYGZhy{}y nginx\PYGZdq{}}

\PYG{l+s+sd}{2. **finish** \PYGZhy{} Report your progress to MainAgent}
\PYG{l+s+sd}{   \PYGZhy{} Use when task is COMPLETE (status=\PYGZdq{}done\PYGZdq{})}
\PYG{l+s+sd}{   \PYGZhy{} Use when you made PROGRESS but need more work (status=\PYGZdq{}partial\PYGZdq{})}
\PYG{l+s+sd}{   \PYGZhy{} MUST use before running out of steps! Your work is LOST if you timeout.}

\PYG{l+s+sd}{**What to report in finish:**}
\PYG{l+s+sd}{\PYGZhy{} completed: List SUCCESSFUL steps that WORKED (e.g., [\PYGZdq{}apt update succeeded\PYGZdq{}, \PYGZdq{}nginx installed\PYGZdq{}])}
\PYG{l+s+sd}{\PYGZhy{} issues: List FAILED attempts with WHY (e.g., [\PYGZdq{}nginx \PYGZhy{}v failed: command not found\PYGZdq{}])}
\PYG{l+s+sd}{\PYGZhy{} message: Brief summary of current state}

\PYG{l+s+sd}{This info helps the NEXT SubAgent know what to repeat and what to avoid.}

\PYG{l+s+sd}{==== Output Format ====}
\PYG{l+s+sd}{CRITICAL: You MUST reply with ONLY a JSON object. No explanations, no markdown, no other text.}

